        "Read the story and the goal. The goal pill turns green when it is fixed.",
        "Look before you touch: `docker ps -a`, `docker logs <name>` and `docker inspect <name>`. The answer is in what Docker tells you.",
        "Fix the cause. Containers keep their settings, so most fixes mean `docker rm` and a new `docker run` with the right flags. Build scenarios have an editor for the Dockerfile and .dockerignore.",
        "Stuck? Type `hint`. Three hints per scenario, each more direct than the last. `reset` starts again, `help` lists every command."
